g holder, which is an ideal support choice for daily mobile phone use.<\/p><h2><strong>Compatible with MagSafe and magnetic mobile phone cases<\/strong><\/h2><p>This ring holder stand is seamlessly compatible with all iPhones and magnetic mobile phone cases that support MagSafe, and is stable and reliable to use. Whether you are walking, playing games or taking selfies, it can keep your phone firmly in place.<\/p><h2><strong>360° rotating ring<\/strong><\/h2><p>You can adjust the angle of the magnetic ring as needed. It can be operated as a stable phone holder with one hand, or it can be flipped to place the phone upright or diagonally, and enjoy the convenience of hands-free mobile phone anytime, anywhere.<\/p><h2><strong>Slim and lightweight, portable design<\/strong><\/h2><p>This magnetic ring for phone combines fashionable design with practical functions. It will not increase the size of the mobile phone, and it is easy to carry in a pocket or bag, providing convenience for daily travel.<\/p><h2><strong>Lanyard for added security<\/strong><\/h2><p>The included lanyard gives you peace of mind when carrying your phone, allowing you to keep your phone firmly in hand while traveling, commuting or outdoor activities.<\/p><h2><strong>Durable and stylish construction<\/strong><\/h2><p>This magnetic phone ring holder is carefully crafted with high-quality materials to last, while also complementing your phone's design with an elegant look.<\/p><h2><strong>Why choose our magnetic phone ring holder and stand?<\/strong><\/h2><p>Whether you are a busy professional, student or content creator, this magnetic phone grip provides a secure grip, hands-free convenience and a versatile stand - all in one stylish package. Upgrade your mobile experience today and enjoy full control and flexibility over your iPhone magnetic phone.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["heading_FLd9Vi","text_V4Q8Ld"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-96a799b1-7dd1-4ab9-af22-7d43edb21dd2","c